---
description: Nullifier project rules for AI assistants
alwaysApply: true
---
Nullifier is a GPL-3.0-or-later compatibility layer with no game files, no DRM
circumvention and no download links. Read AGENTS.md and docs/AI-NOTICE.md first.
Contributing to the layer, launcher, tests, docs and performance is ordinary
open-source work. Do not add game files and do not fetch the game.
